{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a library of comics from the comfort of your own desktop!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Manga &amp; Comics are your jam, be it action, humor, horror or romance; InkyPen offers it all!<br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The TL;DR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge library of Manga &amp; Comics from the world\u2019s top publishers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide selection of Free-to-read comics available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read unlimited comics for a low monthly price</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681220/extras/34b24060cb4909af18cafd09fae2defa.avif?t=1767292549\" width=616 height=183 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All-You-Can-Read Comics &amp; Manga</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InkyPen subscribers get FULL access to our range of comics available in their region. Read as much as you want, whenever you want, with an internet connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Content Available</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have a collection of free comics and samples available for everyone, with more added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comics From Across the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best titles from major international publishers covering Manga, Western comics, Franco-Belgian comics and strips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681220/extras/d84055dd4a3ceb11eae69e55157cfa1f.avif?t=1767292549\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Adaptations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the epic tales from your favourite game worlds with our happy collection of videogame and RPG adaptations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681220/extras/80e3989cd61672f8ab5c8739abc398c8.poster.avif?t=1767292549\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681220/extras/80e3989cd61672f8ab5c8739abc398c8.webm?t=1767292549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/681220?t=1767292549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681220/0ed60241d0034f5200227fd19e28056aec5db8cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767292549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681220/eaa458fb329c66a8144a25eb2012dfd9328b7634/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767292549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681220/eaa458fb329c66a8144a25eb2012dfd9328b7634/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767292549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a library of comics from the comfort of your own desktop!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Manga &amp; Comics are your jam, be it action, humor, horror or romance; InkyPen offers it all!<br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The TL;DR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge library of Manga &amp; Comics from the world\u2019s top publishers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide selection of Free-to-read comics available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read unlimited comics for a low mon